{"id": "De5c4KFS3z8", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Devta aur asur ek hi rassi kheench rahe the... aur woh rassi ek naag tha. 🐍🌊\r\n\r\nAaj Sharad Purnima hai. Part 2: Samudra Manthan aur Maa Lakshmi ka prakat hona, Vishnu Puran (Ansh 1, Adhyay 9) se.\r\n\r\nMandar parvat mathani bana, Vasuki naag rassi. Parvat doobne laga toh Bhagwan Vishnu ne kachhua ban kar use apni peeth par thaam liya. Phir ek-ek kar ratna nikle, aur aakhir mein khile hue kamal par prakat huin Maa Lakshmi. Dishaon ke haathiyon ne sone ke kalashon se unka abhishek kiya, aur unhone vachan diya ki teenon lokon ko phir kabhi nahi chhodengi.\r\n\r\nKojagari Puja ka muhurat: aaj raat 11:40 se 12:31 tak (Drik Panchang). Kheer chaandni mein rakhna mat bhoolna 🌕\r\n\r\nYeh katha Tholu Bommalata mein hai, Andhra Pradesh ki chamde ki kathputli parampara. Har frame code mein banaya.\r\n\r\nAaj raat aap Maa Lakshmi ko kaise yaad karenge? Comment mein likhiye 👇\r\n\r\nPart 1 profile par hai. Save karein aur parivaar ko bhejein 🙏 Jai Maa Lakshmi!\r\n\r\n#sharadpurnima #samudramanthan #lakshmipuja #tholubommalata #jaimaalakshmi", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792889399, "like_count": 1759, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-860688647106769a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 49.054, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMiiMGnuTjtGBs_iuwK_2SZFjAqgbWd9NzMsD42DXRE2G4GZ6PQoPis1VpMbw5u4DjmT4oGY4HOHejcHuBVrZVLLcnzdrTo7VlvP7k.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpQI5